      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e What if the host never issues the __pkvm__vcpu_after_set_cpuid hypercall? Do we still ensure we enable x2APIC in such case?\n\nHmm, BTW also if the host never issues the __pkvm__vcpu_after_set_cpuid hypercall, we don\u0027t call pkvm_enforce_cpuid(). Is that ok?\n\nMaybe we should forbid running a protected vCPU if the host hasn\u0027t set the CPUID for it?",
      "parentUuid": "bf2d086d_67a07454",
      "revId": "863f921b11605d0568635b675b4dea50b7c52825",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
