      "message": "\u003e From the host side, maybe it is still better to move the apic base to pkvm_vcpu_after_set_cpuid to avoid calling guest_cpu_cap_set(vcpu, X86_FEATURE_X2APIC)?\n\nFor the host, maybe can keep the current implementation which is to override apic base after the vcpu is reset by calling `guest_cpu_cap_set(vcpu, X86_FEATURE_X2APIC)`, and then do a `KVM_BUG_ON(guest_cpu_cap_has(vcpu, X86_FEATURE_X2APIC), vcpu-\u003ekvm)` check in the `pkvm_vcpu_after_set_cpuid` to make sure the updated cpu caps still has the X86_FEATURE_X2APIC bit?",
